\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"gallery-count\">This gallery contains 14 items.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5319 post type-post status-publish format-gallery has-post-thumbnail category-plein-air category-events category-news\" id=\"post-5319\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/bells-neck-en-plein-air/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman holding an easel in front of a grassy area.\" src=\"/media/archive/3bf7d2e99e2c953c07cfafb701e13ea354dbbf0fbc0896c566b85bb4cc92137a.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/bells-neck-en-plein-air/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Bell’s Neck En Plein Air</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-24ee350b4de3fb6c4205/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Gallery</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-27T11:39:51-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 27, 2020, 11:39 am\">June 27, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>It started out sunny then became overcast but what fun watching the families come to catch crabs, a birder came to see the Sandhill Crane while walkers greeted us. Join <a href=\"/news/bells-neck-en-plein-air/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"gallery-count\">This gallery contains 5 items.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5348 post type-post status-publish format-gallery has-post-thumbnail category-plein-air category-events category-news\" id=\"post-5348\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"